# Gauss-Jordan Elimination Solver

## 📌 Overview
This project implements the **Gauss-Jordan Elimination Method** in Python to solve a system of linear equations. The program accepts an augmented matrix from the user, performs row operations to convert the matrix into reduced row-echelon form (RREF), and displays the values of the unknown variables.

---

## 🚀 Features
- Solves a system of **n linear equations** with **n variables**.
- Accepts user input for the augmented matrix.
- Automatically performs Gauss-Jordan elimination.
- Displays the solution with decimal precision.
- Detects and reports a zero pivot (mathematical error).

